WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.167
Come on, little one.

00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:17.792
One for you.

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:25.292
John, right?

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:28.750
-Erm, hi. My name's Olivia.
-Yeah, I know.

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.458
The space helmets are just
for publicity shots.

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:33.250
They don't actually
need them.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.667
Oh, ok.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.125
Hey, give me that back!

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:48.458
Why are we sending rabbits?

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:51.083
A load of drunk chimps
would do a better job.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.292
I don't know.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.833
I think we should have
a bit of faith in them,

00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:56.333
like the boss does.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.667
Ok, let's see how
they cope in zero gravity.

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:01.042
Land the plane, quick!

